umd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Resveratrol-enriched yeast, nicotinamide riboside chloride, White Versailles currant fruit extract, rice seed extract (contains ceramide), botanical blend (blood orange fruit extract, spinach leaf juice powder, grape seed extract, red wine powder)</p><p><br></p><h6>ADDITIONAL INGREDIENTS</h6><p><br></p><p>Water, apple juice concentrate, grape juice concentrate, glycerin, purple carrot juice concentrate, xanthan gum, citric acid, sunflower lecithin, gum acacia, steviol glycosides, pectin</p><p><br></p><p><a href="https://happyaging.com/products/longevity-shots#key-points"><u>Learn more about the active ingredients.</u></a></p></span></div><picture data-rid="e103b709-66e2-4c79-bfd3-e046b93ecc2c" class="r-78qyek"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d90ba0bd-536d-4205-9af1-329239efe2fd/478133ef-d27c-44ac-bb76-27a9dc1b3fcd?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d90ba0bd-536d-4205-9af1-329239efe2fd/478133ef-d27c-44ac-bb76-27a9dc1b3fcd?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d90ba0bd-536d-4205-9af1-329239efe2fd/478133ef-d27c-44ac-bb76-27a9dc1b3fcd?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d90ba0bd-536d-4205-9af1-329239efe2fd/478133ef-d27c-44ac-bb76-27a9dc1b3fcd" class="r-km7h1c" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div><div data-rid="f7ab1940-dc88-48d8-a4d8-116fef5ff7b0" class="r-7t0yqz" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="555e8c4f-591a-4305-9ccd-942a57fae6c8" aria-controls="replo-:R2mnv32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2z9u61"><div data-rid="b6eb741d-21e6-4a81-a115-707dffdcd753" class="r-1xhhedm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">How to use</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="28db164f-78aa-4798-bd42-5211911caee2" class="r-1nyb542"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-sswbne" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2mnv32:"><div data-rid="44967d70-3b76-4117-b962-c8dfb9343082" class="r-1i5q37y"><div data-rid="ad74faee-489e-4b52-b0a3-564cb946ae49" class="r-1dhcle0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>How to use</h2></span></div><div data-rid="6d6fc21e-4e3e-4c0a-a37f-cd9443a4cba8" class="r-zd011i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Drink two shots shot per week—either straight from the bottle or over ice with sparkling water. Enjoy with or without food. Shake well before drinking.</p><p><br></p><h6>STORAGE</h6><p><br></p><p>Store at room temperature and away from direct sunlight to preserve potency. Consume within 18 months.</p><p><br></p><h6>A QUICK NOTE</h6><p><br></p><p>We recommend consulting your healthcare provider before adding any supplements to your routine, particularly if you have any health conditions or are taking medications.</p><p>Have more questions? See our FAQs.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<!-- -->{% assign product = reploOriginalProductRv32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedVariant = reploOriginalProductVariantRv32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSortedSellingPlans = reploOriginalSPGRv32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedSellingPlan = reploOriginalSSPRv32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedSellingPlanPrice = reploOriginalSSPPriceRv32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploCompareAtPriceDifferencePercentage = reploOriginalComparePricePercentRv32 %}<!-- -->{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8f85f6ad-2964-46e6-80ad-c5668f793eaa" class="r-wk8lmb"><div data-rid="b675d7c4-d087-45e9-a5b5-19fb40d24d5a" class="r-6l4f3c"><div data-rid="861d2223-93fa-4e4f-9966-3d80de790598" class="r-ccljkt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>frequently asked questions</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="0646e82b-9666-474f-a39c-c5ef8f1097ab" class="r-16udns5"><div data-rid="87f65291-882a-4d7e-bb01-9d80fdb7fedf" class="r-1c1y1e6" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="8d7d2968-be82-4b60-b01a-bdafc90ab703" aria-controls="replo-:Rrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1en3r95"><div data-rid="2a3fa2a5-fd18-41db-bdb8-033b407e0d29" class="r-1xqb0my alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is the Longevity Shot made of?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6ba6a05d-8f77-4925-b089-44f3aed99026" class="r-2fj3sh"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1m1ziu4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rrj2:"><div data-rid="a991618e-a62a-4fe0-bbb3-d4c5eecee6a8" class="r-1w11zs5"><div data-rid="67499d8d-0f4d-4c3d-9ccb-d106cc45c373" class="r-127dz4q alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is crafted entirely from all-natural ingredients, with 80% of the ingredients being non-GMO. It is gluten-free, vegan, caffeine-free, soy-free, and dairy-free, with no synthetic ingredients, artificial sweeteners, preservatives, or artificial colors/flavors. Each shot contains 18 calories per serving.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e331c60e-249e-4ef5-992a-8fffea72a59a" class="r-196pb8u" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="a0a70118-4487-4760-b8c8-ae5ef93dee56" aria-controls="replo-:R1bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-e52h7h"><div data-rid="a0b63ccc-d81e-4ee4-987c-05be8f0165f8" class="r-erqi6b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How should I take the Longevity Shot, and when is the best time?</p></span></div><div data-rid="72eed472-20e2-4908-b4be-3a2c20d2be66" class="r-199slhp"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-wm6fxs" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1bj2:"><div data-rid="f1b95f87-6d37-48df-a7b1-f4fb94d6f14b" class="r-so51yu"><div data-rid="37404714-e78c-4f26-8ccf-1681ac93a338" class="r-tt5enh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking two shots per week, at any time of the day. This schedule helps maintain NAD+ levels and activate sirtuins—proteins vital for cellular health, DNA repair, and metabolic function. This intermittent dosing supports long-term vitality and overall longevity, slowing the aging process without overwhelming your body.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a991c3c8-4b0c-4472-9a61-d9f37911261a" class="r-ojvpd0" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="22bfcc4d-4abe-4021-bea6-e7bf16e93424" aria-controls="replo-:R1rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1vucqxo"><div data-rid="1986fa94-7b6e-48bd-a9c2-aa673143ccac" class="r-306jff alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When will I see results from the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b34d14af-bd3a-4ebd-8837-816ded16292a" class="r-ysk2xp"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1n3z0df" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1rj2:"><div data-rid="56729688-122c-419c-ae32-398bdab9a8a7" class="r-1w3jnvf"><div data-rid="038b7257-7a56-429a-956e-305d7599df74" class="r-1d1fhwj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The timing of results can vary depending on your body and lifestyle. Many women begin to notice positive changes in energy, skin health, and overall well-being within the first 30 days of regular use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ccf816a9-39a8-4035-abf5-20c8c361673b" class="r-qm764e" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="613ddde7-e601-4840-88a2-b6d521b6fa82" aria-controls="replo-:R2bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1j07b1n"><div data-rid="d0b9ec87-c315-43ba-8ff3-3487df048623" class="r-v0wp94 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long should I continue taking the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3ceb9256-828d-4dd3-adc6-ae3c22353d8c" class="r-1k9r4s7"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1a2iv9e" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2bj2:"><div data-rid="46499140-642d-427e-afd9-23c74b971adc" class="r-128g7z7"><div data-rid="8dd320ec-9297-46f8-8363-24274dbfe56e" class="r-pt2ujs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The long-term benefits of the Longevity Shot—such as cellular health support and slowing the aging process—are best experienced over time with consistent use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cfa8ac9b-7f1b-4097-a215-cc750896bede" class="r-jj807c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="b1fab85d-e156-4adf-8a32-35fd84518964" aria-controls="replo-:R2rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-pooo5m"><div data-rid="9345c4ce-e120-42f3-9e42-bf0b98421ec3" class="r-129mpj5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are there any side effects of interactions with medications?</p></span></div><div data-rid="86f31b76-3629-4208-9229-fec3669cce06" class="r-16g3vv5"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1bxf5lp" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2rj2:"><div data-rid="5d291396-3067-4bb8-9813-ef04ee0ba6ff" class="r-7qgxmy"><div data-rid="7da9184e-9592-4e32-a0ae-e9f45793ccff" class="r-1e1pnur alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The natural ingredients in the Longevity Shot are generally well-tolerated, but everyone is unique. If you’re taking any prescription medications or have a medical condition, particularly autoimmune conditions, we encourage you to consult your healthcare provider before starting the Longevity Shot.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="fd287fe6-85aa-4e52-9061-5411287005e6" class="r-1f922it" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="f7994f77-cd36-4221-a11c-56c5ab9bf745" aria-controls="replo-:R3bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1prlpxi"><div data-rid="39d3200b-20a6-41af-9741-7bb10359f0ea" class="r-ocn3vv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does the Longevity Shot contain sugar or alcohol?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d6adf8b1-0588-4137-9d0e-879094086710" class="r-ayc2dc"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1hs8jjw" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3bj2:"><div data-rid="c199aef2-e575-4ab0-90fa-ed7713fafd84" class="r-1eoshw3"><div data-rid="ea5fc703-2c39-40c5-8547-d45063d073fd" class="r-u6539x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot contains 2.5 grams of natural sugar from apple and grape juice concentrate. It is also lightly sweetened with steviol glycosides, a natural sweetener derived from the Stevia rebaudiana plant that is sugar and calorie-free. It is alcohol-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6fd62a1d-d27e-493d-98cf-e796fc287e2b" class="r-bc8kje" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="ad6efcbd-71c7-49f8-b88e-2e129c6859fb" aria-controls="replo-:R3rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-r6m3sg"><div data-rid="99ccf0ef-5a20-4da0-be39-a3abdaca5826" class="r-1w0s8qq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take the Longevity Shot if I’m pregnant or breastfeeding?</p></span></div><div data-rid="1421ffc1-6f33-42ad-b2e1-1f02d188b9c1" class="r-a3kk1o"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-g1k4mz" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3rj2:"><div data-rid="3b0f50ef-5a6a-4d35-b8ca-fcc83a466759" class="r-1ti9130"><div data-rid="e2fb5fc3-a839-4b88-be82-b044b832159d" class="r-16bd4a4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While the Longevity Shot is made with natural ingredients, we always recommend that pregnant or breastfeeding women consult their healthcare provider to ensure it aligns with their unique health needs during this time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="08738a30-f5c4-427f-9c9b-376ac4037c16" class="r-p688hb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="c4935ddf-cf68-4485-9f3d-c74e55101289" aria-controls="replo-:R4bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-yzvlk3"><div data-rid="57a49d4a-f079-48d4-a045-fe3af02e99d6" class="r-1d16cf1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot suitable for children or teenagers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="8023826f-cc3f-4721-8ef0-31bc3bac01dc" class="r-1auogre"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1ikq1z6" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4bj2:"><div data-rid="a16aa394-3646-492a-bf16-5348f1908791" class="r-mo0392"><div data-rid="d4a8e2c3-7345-4dea-993f-b0213212b57a" class="r-1c83sr0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is formulated with adults in mind. If you’re considering it for children or teenagers, we recommend speaking with a healthcare provider to ensure it’s appropriate for their needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0184b777-5cac-474e-a163-72dbe8b6b031" class="r-1w3vtl5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="9289891a-bfab-4067-9d2e-6e5c812bd50d" aria-controls="replo-:R4rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ptvll2"><div data-rid="6439d895-4a93-4819-a315-a8122a0bbc41" class="r-1n44n03 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot safe for those with allergies or dietary restrictions?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9ad19ae6-64ce-4e9a-bf0f-b13471705a90" class="r-8ytsyy"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentatio